d deck featuring a foil Planeswalker card\r\n<br>• 2 Throne of Eldraine booster packs\r\n<br>• 1 strategy insert\r\n<br>• 1 MTG Arena code card*"},{"name":"UPC","displayName":"UPC","value":"630509793129"}]},{"productId":202302,"name":"Theros Beyond Death - Collector Booster Pack Display","cleanName":"Theros Beyond Death Collector Booster Pack Display","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/202302_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2568,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/202302/magic-theros-beyond-death-theros-beyond-death-collector-booster-pack-display","modifiedOn":"2025-11-03T21:57:29.84","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"The Collector Booster gives players immediate access to the coolest, most desirable cards from Theros Beyond Death. Each Collector Booster is packed with the set's most exciting offerings. It’s a supercharged booster experience.<br>\r\n<br>Theros Beyond Death - Collector Booster Box contains:\r\n<br>• 12 Magic: The Gathering—Theros Beyond Death Collector Booster Packs: each Collector Booster Pack contains: 15 Theros Beyond Death cards and 1 foil token\r\n<br>• Two (2) foil Nyx basic lands\r\n<br>• Eight (8) foil common, uncommon, or basic land cards\r\n<br>• One (1) ancillary card (a card that does not appear in Theros Beyond Death Draft Boosters)\r\n<br>• One (1) rare or mythic rare extended frame card\r\n<br>• One (1) foil rare or mythic rare card (one in four packs include an extended frame card instead)\r\n<br>• One (1) saga or showcase frame card\r\n<br>• One (1) foil saga or alternate frame god, demigod, or planeswalker card\r\n<br>• One (1) foil double-sided token."},{"name":"UPC","displayName":"UPC","value":"630509848881"}]},{"productId":202303,"name":"Theros Beyond Death - Theme Booster Display Box","cleanName":"Theros Beyond Death Theme Booster Display Box","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cd