Theros Beyond Death - Collector Booster Pack","cleanName":"Theros Beyond Death Collector Booster Pack","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/206254_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2568,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/206254/magic-theros-beyond-death-theros-beyond-death-collector-booster-pack","modifiedOn":"2019-12-17T17:35:33.917","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":"2020-01-24T00:00:00","note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"There are fifteen cards plus a foil token in each Collector Booster found in eight \"slots\" in the booster. The slots are as follows:\r\n<br><br>\r\n<br> • Two premium foil basic Nyx Lands—these are the full-art lands showcasing Nyx art. Every Collector Booster comes with two foil version lands.\r\n<br> • Eight premium foil common, uncommon, or non-Nyx basic lands—there are 111 commons (including non-Nyx basic lands) and 80 uncommons in the set. Each booster will have eight cards from among those cards.\r\n<br> • One ancillary card—each booster will contain one card from a <strong>Theros Beyond Death</strong> ancillary release, including Planeswalker Decks, Theme Boosters, and the Buy-a-Box promo.\r\n<br> • One non-foil rare or mythic with the extended-art frame—similar to the <strong>Throne of Eldraine</strong> Collector Booster frames, these have extended art across the borders.\r\n<br> • One premium foil rare or mythic rare—these can be either standard-frame or foil versions of the Collector Booster frame (point 4 above).\r\n<br> • One non-foil Saga or constellation showcase-frame card—these can be uncommon, rare, or mythic rare and can include the borderless planeswalkers.\r\n<br> • One foil constellation showcase-frame card—this slot will have one of the five uncommon showcase demigods, one of the six showcase rares, or one of the three borderless planeswalkers.\r\n<br> • One premium foil double-sided token from <strong>Theros Beyond Death</strong>."},{"name":"UPC","displayName":"UPC","value":"630509848881"}]},{"productId":206255,"name":"Theros Beyond Death - Planeswalker Deck [Ashiok]","cleanName":"Theros Beyond Death Planeswalker Deck Ashiok","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/206255_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2568,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/206255/magic-theros-beyond-death-theros-beyond-death-planeswalker-deck-ashiok","modifiedOn":"2019-12-20T18:52:26.083","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":"2020-01-24T00:00:00","note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Planeswalker Decks are ready to play right out of the box and familiarize players with the characters, mechanics, and setting of Theros Beyond Death. They offer a great opportunity for players who are interested in Magic to learn the game.\r\n<br><br>\r\nContents: \r\n<br>• 1 ready-to-play 60-card deck featuring a foil planeswalker card\r\n<br>• 2 Theros Beyond Death Draft Boosters\r\n<br>• 1 strategy insert\r\n<br>• 1 MTG Arena code card*\r\n*Available only in certain regions"}]},{"productId":206256,"name":"Theros Beyond Death - Planeswalker Deck [Elspeth]","cleanName":"Theros Beyond Death Planeswalker Deck Elspeth","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/206256_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2568,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/206256/magic-theros-beyond-death-theros-beyond-death-planeswalker-deck-elspeth","modifiedOn":"2019-12-20T18:52:34.923","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":"2020-01-24T00:00:00","note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Planeswalker Decks are ready to play right out of the box and familiarize players with the characters, mechanics, and setting of Theros Beyond Death. They offer a great opportunity for players who are interested in Magic to learn the game.\r\n<br><br>\r\nContents: \r\n<br>•